  </div>

  <hr class="my-5">

  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-12 text-center mb-4">
      <h2>What happens when you bring your bicycle?</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">A transparent process, from start to finish.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3 class="h5 card-title text-primary">1. Initial Assessment</h3>
          <p class="card-text">We receive your bicycle at the service counter. We perform a visual and mechanical inspection with you to understand exactly what you need.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body">
