          <p class="card-text">We’ll put together a quote for you on the spot based on our public price list. If you approve it, the bike goes into the work queue.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h3 class="h5 card-title text-primary">3. Repair and Delivery</h3>
          <p class="card-text">Our mechanics do the work. We’ll send you a message as soon as it’s been tested, cleaned, and is ready to hit the road again.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
